{"chunk_id": "b757c6da-8223-45c8-ba1d-fd3fe42b040b", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/voter_registration/documents/VRA-Amharic.pdf", "title": "VRA Amharic", "section_hierarchy": ["Voter Registration", "Documents"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 0, "chunk_total": 6, "word_count": 11, "text": "የትልልቅ መራጮች ምዝገባመተግበሪያዎች የሚገኙት: በ ካውንቲው የምርጫ ቦርድ የግዛቱ የምርጫ ቦርድ", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:18:01.370293+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "f2b6539b-bb06-4d04-be7e-9920139a316d", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/voter_registration/documents/VRA-Amharic.pdf", "title": "VRA Amharic", "section_hierarchy": ["Voter Registration", "Documents"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 6, "word_count": 5, "text": "የትልልቅ መራጮች ምዝገባመተግበሪያዎች የሚገኙት: ነው።", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:18:01.370308+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "becc650a-b9f8-4f95-ab67-58c4c747a27e", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/voter_registration/documents/VRA-Amharic.pdf", "title": "VRA Amharic", "section_hierarchy": ["Voter Registration", "Documents"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_total": 6, "word_count": 9, "text": "• ቅጹ ኦሪጂናል ፊርማ ስለሚያስፈልገው በፋክስ ወይም በኢሜይል: አይላኩ።", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:18:01.370314+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "cbd3acea-4493-4606-a10c-cecb22f8b892", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/voter_registration/documents/VRA-Amharic.pdf", "title": "VRA Amharic", "section_hierarchy": ["Voter Registration", "Documents"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_total": 6, "word_count": 17, "text": "• ቅጹ ኦሪጂናል ፊርማ ስለሚያስፈልገው በፋክስ ወይም በኢሜይል: • የክልል አቀፍ ቪአርኤ (VRA) ለአካባቢው ቦርድ ባለስልጣን፣ ሰራተኛ", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:18:01.370319+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "3eed074c-1096-4e6c-9d90-f126034c34a1", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/voter_registration/documents/VRA-Amharic.pdf", "title": "VRA Amharic", "section_hierarchy": ["Voter Registration", "Documents"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 4, "chunk_total": 6, "word_count": 17, "text": "• ቅጹ ኦሪጂናል ፊርማ ስለሚያስፈልገው በፋክስ ወይም በኢሜይል: ወይም ወኪል ካልሆነ በስተቀር ለሌላ ግለሰብ ማስገባት ቅጹ በወቅቱ", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:18:01.370324+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "0cebbf8d-520b-4ab8-a55d-ffb0bedb83f1", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/voter_registration/documents/VRA-Amharic.pdf", "title": "VRA Amharic", "section_hierarchy": ["Voter Registration", "Documents"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 5, "chunk_total": 6, "word_count": 12, "text": "• ቅጹ ኦሪጂናል ፊርማ ስለሚያስፈልገው በፋክስ ወይም በኢሜይል: እንደሚቀርብ ወይም እንደሚቀርብ አያረጋግጥም።", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:18:01.370328+00:00"}
