{"chunk_id": "9568fa42-f0c0-433e-ada6-fb382f8dfdea", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/summary_guide/coo.pdf", "title": "coo", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf", "Summary Guide"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 27, "chunk_total": 28, "word_count": 10, "text": ": the voter. Date notice sent ____________ Staff Initials: ______________________", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:25:25.103676+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "50b1699a-bbde-46c4-bc79-e3866ecaa5f9", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/summary_guide/rocot.pdf", "title": "rocot", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf", "Summary Guide"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 0, "chunk_total": 1, "word_count": 179, "text": "Officer Resignation Form\nIn accordance with §13-207(d)(1) of the Election Law Article, Annotated Code\nof Maryland, as of ___________________, __________ I hereby resign as:\n(month/day) (year)\nChairman for: ____________________________________________________________\n(Name of Campaign Finance Entity)\nTreasurer for: ____________________________________________________________\n(Name of Campaign Finance Entity)\nAnd, I hereby certify that I have returned all records relating to the campaign finance entity to\nthe remaining officer or the candidate and I have completed all of my campaign finance\nreporting responsibilities.*\n_______________________________________________________\nSignature of Resigning Officer\n_______________________________________________________\nPrinted Name of Resigning Officer\n_______________________\nDate\n*Depending on when you file your resignation, you may remain liable for the next Campaign Finance\nReport. Call the State Board of Elections to clarify your reporting responsibilities. In addition, it is\nrecommended that you file a statement with your resignation reporting your committee or entity’s cash\nbalance, the amount of money in the checking account, and any outstanding obligations.\nState Board of Elections\nDivision of Candidacy and Campaign Finance\n151 West Street, Suite 200/P.O. Box 6486, Annapolis, MD 21401-0486\n(410) 269-2880 (800) 222-8683 ext. 4\nSBE/CCF 13-207-1 Revised 03/2007", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:25:26.097342+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "2c6d2dcb-cfe8-4d8b-bda4-659b83a88da7", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/summary_guide/cfrsp.pdf", "title": "cfrsp", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf", "Summary Guide"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 0, "chunk_total": 1, "word_count": 435, "text": "Maryland State Board of Elections\nCampaign Finance Report Summary Sheet\n\nPart 1\nEntity Name: Entity # Report Due Date:\nTransaction Period > This Report covers transactions beginning and ending\n\nDate Date\n\nQ) Final Report (Check if you intend to close the account. This cannot be a final report if a cash balance or outstanding obligation remains)\n8 Amendment # (Date amendment is being filed )\n\nPart 2\nBank Account Name Bank Account Number Bank Account Balance*\n\n*As of the report transaction ending date. Total |\n\nPart 3 Part 4\n\nReceipts\nContributions — Schd 1, Col A\n\nTicket Purchases — Schd 1, Col B\nFederal Committees — Schd 1, Col C Prior Balance\nPolitical Clubs — Schd 1, Col D\n\nMD Candidate and Slate Accounts — Schd 1A, Col E +\n\nReport calculated cash balance\nfrom Part 4 of your prior report.\n\nMD Party Central Committees — Schd 1A, Col F\nMD Political Action Committees — Schd 1A, Col G Total Receipts\nNon-Federal Out-of-State Committees — Schd 1A, Col H\nOther — Schd 1B, Col I -\n\nLoans — Schd 3, Col K .\nEnter Total in Part 4 (Total Receipts) Total Expenditures [ Total of Part 3 Expenditures\n\nTotal of Part 3 Receipts\n\nExpenditures _\n\nSalaries & Other Compensation — Schd 2, Col N ~\n\nRent & Other Office Expenses — Schd 2, Col O This is your report calculated cash\nField Expenses — Schd 2, Col P Cash Balance balance. Carry forward this\nMedia — Schd 2, Col Q balance to your next report.\n\nPrinting & Campaign Materials — Schd 2, Col R\nDirect Mailing by Mail House — Schd 2, Col S\n\nPostage — Schd 2, Col T Part 5\nPurchase of Equipment — Schd 2, Col U Value of In-Kind Contributions — Schd 1B, Col J\nFundraising Expenses — Schd 2, Col V Value of In-Kind Expenditures — Schd 2, Col AA\nTransfers Out — Schd 2, Col W\nLoan Repayment — Schd 2, Col X Part 6\nOther — Schd 2, Col Y Outstanding Loan Balance — Schd 3, Col L\nReturned Contribution — Schd 2, Col Z Outstanding Bills Due — Schd 3, Col M\nEnter Total in Part 4 (Total Expenditures) Total Outstanding Obligations\n\nPart 7\n\nUnder penalty of perjury, we declare that we have examined this report, including the accompanying schedules, and to the best of our\nknowledge and belief they are complete and accurate.\n\n(Date)\nSignature of Treasurer .\nWarning\n(Date) Failure to provide all information required by\nSignature of Chairman this form will be regarded as a failure to file.\n\nAll Reports must bear original signatures.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:25:28.519300+00:00"}
