{"chunk_id": "d054e3fb-9e2a-4c21-b6d5-465d1f220931", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/summary_guide/s1a.pdf", "title": "s1a", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf", "Summary Guide"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 0, "chunk_total": 1, "word_count": 157, "text": "Forms may be duplicated as needed. Page _______ of ________\nReport Due Date _______________\nSchedule 1A – Transfers in\n(see Schedules 1 and 1B for other types of Income)\nSee instructions on reverse side\nName of Entity _________________________________________________________________________\nEntity Number __________________________\nE F G H\nFrom MD From MD Party From MD PACs From Non-\nDate Name and Address of the Campaign Finance Entity from which the Candidate Central Federal Out of\nReceived Campaign Committees State PACs\ntransfer is received. Finance Entities\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nAggregate to\nDate\n$\nTOTALS THIS PAGE E F G H\nFailure to provide all the information required by this form will be regarded as a FAILURE TO FILE.\nSBE-13-03 (Rev.4/03)", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:25:30.626796+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "89b3070b-2207-40d9-b2ba-d470e5447c87", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/summary_guide/s1b.pdf", "title": "s1b", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf", "Summary Guide"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 0, "chunk_total": 1, "word_count": 134, "text": "Page ____ of _______\nReport Due Date _______________\nSchedule 1B\nOther Receipts and In-Kind Contributions\n(see Schedules 1 and 1A for other types of Income)\nSee instructions on reverse side\nName of Entity __________________________________________________________________________\nEntity Number _________________\nI J\nDate Complete Name and Address of Payor Other - Refunds, In-Kind Contribution - A Remarks\nReceived Rebates, Items sold, Fair Market Value of D\ninterest or misc. In-Kind Contribution M\nI\nincome. (Describe in Received. (Describe in\nN\nRemarks) Remarks)\n(cid:1)\nAggregate to Date:\n$\nAggregate to Date:\n$\nAggregate to Date:\n$\nAggregate to Date:\n$\nAggregate to Date:\n$\nAggregate to Date:\n$\nAggregate to Date:\n$\nTotals This Page\nI J\nFailure to provide all the information required by this form will be regarded as a FAILURE TO FILE.\nSBE-13-03 (Rev. 4-03)", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:25:31.713952+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "91677d5b-acda-42be-8d41-8cb6036a206b", "source_url": "https://elections.maryland.gov/pdf/summary_guide/s2.pdf", "title": "s2", "section_hierarchy": ["Pdf", "Summary Guide"], "page_classification": "document", "chunking_strategy": "document_extraction", "chunk_index": 0, "chunk_total": 2, "word_count": 70, "text": "Code: Description | N: Salaries and\nother\ncompensation | O: Rent and\nother office\nexpenses | P*: Field\nExpenses | Q: Media | R: Printing and\nCampaign\nMaterials | S: Direct\nMailing by\nMail House | T: Postage | U*: Purchase of\nEquipment | V*: Fundraising\nExpenses | W: Transfers\nOut to Other\nMaryland\nTreasurers | X: Loan\nRepayment | Y*: Other | Z: Returned\nContribution | AA*: In-kind\nExpenditure", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T16:25:32.873449+00:00"}
