{"chunk_id": "27701b51-171c-422e-b8c8-bcfea725b378", "source_url": "local://2026-01/Election Plan Board Presentation Part 1.pdf", "title": "Election Plan Board Presentation Part 1", "section_hierarchy": ["2026-01"], "page_classification": "local_document", "chunking_strategy": "local_pdf", "chunk_index": 6, "chunk_total": 47, "word_count": 291, "text": "Consolidated LINCOLN 200 MADISON precinct. No suitable 2002 ELEMENTARY No 02-001 N STREET facility available in SCHOOL 02-002 Absorbed 02-013 due Waverley Elem to matching ballot 2013 201 WAVERLY DR No 02-008 N School Gym style. 2018 location is no longer available. MONOCACY ELEM 2015 7421 HAYWARD RD No 02-010 N No suitable facility SCHOOL 2018 Private location with consistent, ongoing challenges to reaching point of contact during the critical election Governor Thomas 1799 period. Location also 2018 Johnson Middle SCHIFFERSTADT No 02-007 Y had extensive School Media Center BLVD restrictions on what election judges could have for food/drinks/etc. due to church procedures. This location was very hard to staff, was unavilable in 2020, and was never able to reach a POC in 2022, necessitating relocation at that time. SUGARLOAF 3400 STONE BARN No suitable facility 7001 ELEMENTARY No 07-007 N DRIVE available. SCHOOL URBANA No suitable facility 7007 REGIONAL 9020 AMELUNG ST No 07-004 N available. LIBRARY OAKDALE 5810 OAKDALE No suitable facility 9003 No 09-006 Y MIDDLE SCHOOL SCHOOL ROAD available. MT PLEASANT No suitable facility 13003 8101 CRUM RD No 13-001 N RURITAN CLUB available. THURMONT No suitable facility 15001 408 EAST MAIN ST No 15-002 N MIDDLE SCHOOL available. THURMONT 7989 ROCKY No suitable facility 15003 No 15-002 N PRIMARY SCHOOL RIDGE RD available. LINGANORE HIGH 12013 OLD No suitable facility 18002 No 09-005 N SCHOOL B ANNAPOLIS ROAD available. YELLOW SPRINGS 8717 YELLOW No suitable facility 21003 No 21-001 N ELEM SCH SPRINGS RD available. WHITTIER ELEM 21008 2400 WHITTIER DR No 21-002 SCHOOL BROOK HILL UN