{"chunk_id": "80d462c7-4ff7-43be-9448-100c834bc117", "source_url": "local://2026-02/Title 13 Late Fee Waivers.pdf", "title": "Title 13 Late Fee Waivers", "section_hierarchy": ["2026-02"], "page_classification": "local_document", "chunking_strategy": "local_pdf", "chunk_index": 23, "chunk_total": 24, "word_count": 192, "text": "Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Denied Maryland Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page General Account Name Ward, LaTasha Friends of CCF ID: 1009989 Status: Active Date Established 2/25/14 Date Waiver Requested 2/12/26 Account Type Campaign Account Officers Current Treasurer Darrell Morrison Start Date: 1/13/20 Responsible Treasurer End Date: Current Chairman Brustina Dillard 2/12/26 Responsible Chairman End Date: Reports Requested Late Report Affidavit Date Received Fees Total Fees 2026 Annual 2/11/26 $735 $735 $ $ $ $ Total: $735.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s). Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP 2025 Annual $60.00 outstanding yes 2024 Annual $210.00 outstanding yes 2024 Pre-General 1 $1000 outstanding yes Recent Financial Activity History/ Three Reports Report Contributions Expenditures Cash Balance Outstanding/ Loans/ Obligations 2026 Annual Affidavit $ $ $ $ 2025 Annual Affidavit $ $ $ $ 2024 Annual Affidavit $ $ $ $ Reason for Waiver The candidate states her treasurer has mental issues. She was told by the treasurer everything was taken care of, but when she logged into her account, she found several late fees. Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Denied", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T18:09:43.996610+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "b2dae79a-ed9b-4ccb-a40e-bac20422bebe", "source_url": "local://2026-02/Title 14 Persons Doing business 2.pdf", "title": "Title 14 Persons Doing business 2", "section_hierarchy": ["2026-02"], "page_classification": "local_document", "chunking_strategy": "local_pdf", "chunk_index": 0, "chunk_total": 18, "word_count": 174, "text": "Jared DeMarinis Michael Summers, Chairman State Administrator Jim Shalleck, Vice Chairman Diane Butler Katherine Berry Deputy Administrator Victoria Jackson-Stanley Eric Bryant Memorandum TO: State Board Members FROM: Allen Norfleet, Director Division of Candidacy and Campaign Finance DATE: February 19, 2026 SUBJECT: Waiver of late filing fees – Persons Doing Public Business, Title 14 of the Election Law Article Enclosed are the waiver requests, which were submitted by businesses that have been assessed late filing fees. The attached Waiver Request Information Page contains an overview of each entity as well as the Agency’s recommendation to the Board. The Board should consider the following factors in determining whether just cause exists to grant a waiver. 1. Administrative error of any kind on the part of the Division. 2. The lateness is due to extenuating circumstances, i.e. physical illness or death in the family; or 3. Computer problems occurred which made timely filing impossible. However, the filer still must have demonstrated a good faith effort to timely file. Prior to the meeting please review each waiver request.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T18:09:45.564021+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "0c6c6585-dc96-402d-8eba-1057663af112", "source_url": "local://2026-02/Title 14 Persons Doing business 2.pdf", "title": "Title 14 Persons Doing business 2", "section_hierarchy": ["2026-02"], "page_classification": "local_document", "chunking_strategy": "local_pdf", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 18, "word_count": 297, "text": "Administrative error of any kind on the part of the Division. 2. The lateness is due to extenuating circumstances, i.e. physical illness or death in the family; or 3. Computer problems occurred which made timely filing impossible. However, the filer still must have demonstrated a good faith effort to timely file. Prior to the meeting please review each waiver request. Note the recommendations that you may disagree with or have questions on that you would like to discuss. § 14-107(c) Late Filing Fees (1) As provided in this subsection, the State Board may impose fees for late filing of: (i) a statement required under § 14–104 of this title; or (ii) an amended statement required under subsection (b) of this section. (2) The State Board may impose late filing fees in the same amounts and in the same manner as provided under § 13–331(a) and (b) of this article for late filing of campaign finance reports. (3) Late filing fees imposed under this subsection shall be distributed to the FAX (410) 974- 2019 Toll Free Phone Number (800) 222-8683 151 West Street Suite 200 MD Relay Service (800) 735-2258 https://elections.maryland.gov Annapolis, Maryland 21401 Insert Subject Line Insert Date Page 2 of 2 Fair Campaign Financing Fund. Pursuant to COMAR 33.20.07.01C, the State Administrator has denied six late fee waiver request. No Board action is required on the denial As of February 13, 2026, SBE has collected $50,533.00 in late fees year to date for Title 14 Late Fee Waivers. SBE collected $37,273.00 for the month of February in late fees. Title 14 Waivers 1. Awi Inc 2. BA Construction 3. Baltimore Corps 4. Barnwood Management LLC. 5. Garrett County Chamber of Commerce 6. Generation Properties LLC 7. IGT Canada Solutions ULC 8. It's My Amphitheater, Inc 9.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T18:09:45.564042+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "105ff3fc-246b-4239-911e-57dc243098ce", "source_url": "local://2026-02/Title 14 Persons Doing business 2.pdf", "title": "Title 14 Persons Doing business 2", "section_hierarchy": ["2026-02"], "page_classification": "local_document", "chunking_strategy": "local_pdf", "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_total": 18, "word_count": 264, "text": "SBE collected $37,273.00 for the month of February in late fees. Title 14 Waivers 1. Awi Inc 2. BA Construction 3. Baltimore Corps 4. Barnwood Management LLC. 5. Garrett County Chamber of Commerce 6. Generation Properties LLC 7. IGT Canada Solutions ULC 8. It's My Amphitheater, Inc 9. MarketPro South, Inc. 10. Maryland Association for the Treatment of Opioid Dependence 11. Maryland Consumer Credit Association 12. Maryland Naturopathic Doctors Association 13. Maryland Retired School Personnel Association, Inc. 14. National Center on Institutions and Alternatives 15. Project Stevedoring LLC 16. Securities Industry & Financial Markets Association 17. Service Contract Industry Council Profile Securities Industry & Financial Markets Association 18. SMART Transportation Division 19. Turo 20. Vulcan Materials Company 21. Walgreen Co. 22. Yukon Inc Denied 1. AFCO Cargo BWI II LLC 2. Bridge IT 3. KM Printing, LLC 4. Stadium Square Holdings 5. CVP-TF 6. Tenex Software Solutions, Inc Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name AWL II, Inc. BID ID: BID #16017127 Date Established 7/01/22 Date Waiver Requested 12/19/25 Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist/ Person Doing Business Officers Principal Officer John Shooton Start Date: 7/01/22 Current Filer Lori McCutchen Start Date: 7/01/22 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Fall 2025 12 /19/25 $585 $585 Spring 2025 12 /19/25 $1000 $1000 Fall 2024 12 /19/25 $1000 $1000 Spring 2024 12 /19/25 $1000 $1000 Fall 2023 12 /19/25 $1000 $1000 Spring 2023 12 /19/25 $1000 $1000 Fall 2022 12 /19/25 $1000 $1000 Total:6,585.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s).", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T18:09:45.564053+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "45f42f8c-df8a-4d88-9354-a2f9b4555668", "source_url": "local://2026-02/Title 14 Persons Doing business 2.pdf", "title": "Title 14 Persons Doing business 2", "section_hierarchy": ["2026-02"], "page_classification": "local_document", "chunking_strategy": "local_pdf", "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_total": 18, "word_count": 291, "text": "Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business stated they were unaware of the filing obligation until they received the letter on 11/10/25 Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Reduce to half. Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name BA Construction, Inc. BID ID: 14000649 Date Established 1/04/16 Date Waiver Requested Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist/ Person Doing Business Officers Principal Officer Manuel Gutierrez Start Date: 1/04/16 Current Filer Manuel Gutierrez Start Date: 1/04/16 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Fall 2025 $1000 $1000 Spring 2025 $1000 $1000 Total: $2000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s). Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business is requesting a waiver regarding the reporting and fee requirements assessed after the company was no longer in business. After receiving the initial notice of noncompliance, they promptly updated the records to include the appropriate end dates. In addition, they submitted a Final Affidavit report in March 2024 to formally close the entity and indicate that no further filings would be required. Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Grant and close the account. Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name Baltimore Corps, Inc. BID ID: 14001149 Date Established 7/27/20 Date Waiver Requested 1/29/26 Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist/ Person Doing Business Officers Principal Officer Monique Boyd Start Date: 7/27/20 Current Filer Monique Boyd Start Date: 7/27/20 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Fall 2025 12/02/25 $1000 $1000 $ $ Total: $1,000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s).", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T18:09:45.564063+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "ee6dff4a-ae89-4368-be39-2475a6df4fd5", "source_url": "local://2026-02/Title 14 Persons Doing business 2.pdf", "title": "Title 14 Persons Doing business 2", "section_hierarchy": ["2026-02"], "page_classification": "local_document", "chunking_strategy": "local_pdf", "chunk_index": 4, "chunk_total": 18, "word_count": 290, "text": "Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states they are a 501 (c) 3 Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Grant and close account. Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name Barwood Management LLC BID ID: 16017123 Date Established 7/14/25 Date Waiver Requested 1/08/26 Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist/ Person Doing Business Officers Principal Officer Matt Mohebbi Start Date: 7/14/25 Current Filer William Sapp Start Date: 7/14/25 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Fall 2025 1/08/26 $1000 $1000 $ $ Total: $1000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s). Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states they were unaware of the filing requirement until Jan 1, 2026 Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Reduce to half. Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name Garrett County Chamber of Commerce BID ID: 16017010 Date Established 11/01/22 Date Waiver Requested 1/12/26 Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist/ Person Doing Business Officers Principal Officer Nickolas Sharps Start Date: 11/01/22 Current Filer Regina Sweitzer Start Date: 11/01/22 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Spring 2023 11/04/25 $1000 $1000 Fall 2023 11/04/25 $1000 $1000 Spring 2024 11/04/25 $1000 $1000 Fall 2024 11/04/25 $1000 $1000 Spring 2025 11/04/25 $1000 $1000 Total: $5,000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s). Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states they had no contributions; they did not receive prior notice of filing. Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Reduce to half.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T18:09:45.564073+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "95c5cf6e-1fc3-4b1a-ab87-7cbf11e29771", "source_url": "local://2026-02/Title 14 Persons Doing business 2.pdf", "title": "Title 14 Persons Doing business 2", "section_hierarchy": ["2026-02"], "page_classification": "local_document", "chunking_strategy": "local_pdf", "chunk_index": 5, "chunk_total": 18, "word_count": 288, "text": "Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states they had no contributions; they did not receive prior notice of filing. Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Reduce to half. Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name Generation Properties LLC BID ID: 16017176 Date Established 11/01/23 Date Waiver Requested 2/09/26 Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist/ Person Doing Business Officers Principal Officer Eric Bailey Start Date: 11/01/23 Current Filer Eric Bailey Start Date: 11/01/23 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Spring & Fall 2025 12/18/25 $2000 $2000 Spring & Fall 2024 12/18/25 $2000 $2000 Total: $4,000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s). Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states they were unaware of the filing requirement. It was hard navigating the system, and they did not receive the login credential after the account was active. Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Reduce to $2000. Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name IGT Canada Solutions ULC BID ID: 14000122 Date Established 1/01/15 Date Waiver Requested 2/04/26 Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist/ Person Doing Business Officers Principal Officer Stephen Calogero Start Date: 1/01/15 Current Filer Stephen Calogero Start Date: 1/01/15 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Fall 2025 12/02/25 $1000 $1000 $ $ Total: $1,000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s). Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states the contract with the state expired some time ago.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T18:09:45.564083+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "bba71ae9-e63a-4a62-9f0a-01f12e85af98", "source_url": "local://2026-02/Title 14 Persons Doing business 2.pdf", "title": "Title 14 Persons Doing business 2", "section_hierarchy": ["2026-02"], "page_classification": "local_document", "chunking_strategy": "local_pdf", "chunk_index": 6, "chunk_total": 18, "word_count": 219, "text": "Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states the contract with the state expired some time ago. The company split so they were not aware the reports needed to be completed. Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Grant and close account. Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name It's My Amphitheater, Inc BID ID: 16017031 Date Established 1/01/20 Date Waiver Requested 1/12/26 Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist/ Person Doing Business Officers Principal Officer Gena Gordon Start Date: 1/01/20 Current Filer Carol Parker Start Date: 1/01/20 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Fall 2021 11/29/25 $1000 $1000 Spring, Fall 2022 11/29/25 $2000 $2000 Spring, Fall 2023 11/29/25 $2000 $2000 Spring, Fall 2024 11/29/25 $2000 $2000 Spring 2025 11/29/25 $1000 $1000 Fall 2025 1/13/26 $1000 $1000 Total: $9,000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s). Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states no contributions were made, they apologize for being late and will make every effort that this does not happen again. Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Reduce to half. Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name MarketPro South, Inc.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T18:09:45.564091+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "617a690c-d032-46f9-9436-2a9523ccb2d6", "source_url": "local://2026-02/Title 14 Persons Doing business 2.pdf", "title": "Title 14 Persons Doing business 2", "section_hierarchy": ["2026-02"], "page_classification": "local_document", "chunking_strategy": "local_pdf", "chunk_index": 7, "chunk_total": 18, "word_count": 275, "text": "Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Reduce to half. Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name MarketPro South, Inc. BID ID: 16017110 Date Established 3/01/23 Date Waiver Requested 1/07/26 Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist/ Person Doing Business Officers Principal Officer Robin Bogin Start Date: 3/01/23 Current Filer Martin Zhou Start Date: 3/01/23 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Fall 2024 12/01/25 $1000 $1000 Spring 2024 12/01/25 $1000 $1000 Fall 2023 12/01/25 $1000 $1000 Spring 2023 12/01/25 $1000 $1000 Spring 2025 12/01/25 $1000 $1000 Total: $5,000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s). Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states they do not make contributions to political campaigns. Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Reduce to half. Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name Maryland Association for the Treatment of Opioid Dependence BID ID: 1601720 Date Established 1/01/25 Date Waiver Requested 1/14/26 Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist/ Person Doing Business Officers Principal Officer Connie Dausch Start Date: 1/01/25 Current Filer Terron Powell Start Date: 1/01/02 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Fall 2025 1/08/26 $1000 $1000 Spring 2025 1/08/26 $1000 $1000 Total: $2,000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s). Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states they did not pay a lobbyist during this time period and thought they would not need to file a report. Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Reduce to half.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T18:09:45.564100+00:00"}
{"chunk_id": "641436e1-42ec-47a7-9f3a-bfe163c4ad8b", "source_url": "local://2026-02/Title 14 Persons Doing business 2.pdf", "title": "Title 14 Persons Doing business 2", "section_hierarchy": ["2026-02"], "page_classification": "local_document", "chunking_strategy": "local_pdf", "chunk_index": 8, "chunk_total": 18, "word_count": 288, "text": "Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states they did not pay a lobbyist during this time period and thought they would not need to file a report. Division Comments Administrator’s Decision Reduce to half. Business Contribution Disclosure System RECONSIDERATION Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name Maryland Naturopathic Doctors Association BID ID: 14002174 Date Established 6/03/24 Date Waiver Requested 1/20/26 Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist Officers Principal Officer Skye Stewart Start Date: 6/03/24 Current Filer Linn Wheeling Start Date: 6/03/24 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Spring 2025 $1000 $1000 $ $ Total:$1,000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s). Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP Fall 2024 $1000 outstanding Yes $ Reason for Waiver The information received in June of this year created some confusion, as they were informed that MNDA had been removed from the system, as they do not have a Political Action Committee (PAC), nor has the MNDA made any contribution to a Maryland candidate for office. The business states they are a non-profit. Agency Comments Administrator’s Decision Grant Business Contribution Disclosure System Waiver Request Information Page-Late Fees General Account Name Maryland Retired School Personnel Association, Inc BID ID: 16017111 Date Established 7/01/22 Date Waiver Requested 1/07/26 Account Type Title 14-Employing Lobbyist/ Person Doing Business Officers Principal Officer Elizabeth Weller Start Date: 7/01/22 Current Filer Wanda Twigg Start Date: 7/01/22 Waiver Request Dates Late Report Date Received Fees Total Fees Fall 2022 1/07/2026 $1000 $1000 Spring 2023 1/07/2026 $1000 $1000 Total: $2,000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s).", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T18:09:45.564110+00:00"}
