6 $1000 $1000 Spring 2025 12/03/25 $1000 $1000 Fall 2024 6/02/25 $1000 $1000 Total: $3,000.00 All required notices were sent to this campaign account for the above listed report(s). Prior Waiver and Fees Report Late Fee Waiver/payment Referred OSP N/A $ $ Reason for Waiver The business states they are 501 (c) 3 and are not required to file.", "date_extracted": "2026-04-17T18:09:45.564120+00:00"}
